## State & Data Flow

- Global state via Zustand stores in feature folders:
  - Tasks: [features/pomodoro/store/tasks.js](mdc:src/features/pomodoro/store/tasks.js)
  - Journals: [features/journals/store/journals.js](mdc:src/features/journals/store/journals.js)
  - Auth/Settings: [features/auth/store/auth.js](mdc:src/features/auth/store/auth.js)
- Fetch on Dashboard mount: see [features/dashboard/pages/Dashboard/index.jsx](mdc:src/features/dashboard/pages/Dashboard/index.jsx)
- Keep API updates in sync with store using store's `update` helpers
- Maintain ordering fields like `rank` on sortable resources

### Transformers

- Use transformers for DB↔UI mapping to keep component code in camelCase
- Shared transformer utilities: [shared/utils/transformers/common.js](mdc:src/shared/utils/transformers/common.js)
- Feature-specific transformers:
  - Tasks: [features/pomodoro/utils/transformers/tasks.js](mdc:src/features/pomodoro/utils/transformers/tasks.js)
  - User Settings: [features/settings/utils/transformers/userSettings.js](mdc:src/features/settings/utils/transformers/userSettings.js)
